# =============================================================================
# Git ignore — student-safe repository
# =============================================================================
# Intended committed courseware lives at repo root:
#   README.md, 00_Course_Agenda.md, Module_01–08/, assets/
#
# Everything below must not be shown to students and must not be committed.
# =============================================================================

# --- Trainer / private (answer keys, coaching, audits) ---
Instructor_Materials/
**/Instructor_Materials/
**/*_Instructor.md
**/*_Student.md
_private_validation/
**/_private_validation/

# --- Authoring aids (not participant courseware) ---
master-prompt.md
course-content.md
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt

# --- Secrets / credentials (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
credentials.csv
secrets/
**/secrets/
*accessKey*
*secret*access*
*.aws/
.aws/credentials

# --- Editor / OS / temp ---
~$*
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# --- Local tooling / agent noise (if present under repo) ---
.cursor/
agent-transcripts/
**/terminals/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# --- Archives that might accidentally include full repo dumps ---
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
ADX_AWS_Training_Student/
**/ADX_AWS_Training_Student/
